            <RURComments xml:space="preserve">
                <airSeal>At the time of the inspection we notice some air leakage on the following house components:

-Receptacles

The house was pretty airtight we only find very small leakage from the receptacles. Weather strippings should help to increase the airtightness of the item listed above.

</airSeal>
                <ceilingsCathedral>At the moment of the assessment, the attic insulation level was R-40. The homeowner is planning to add more insulation. The incentive offered by the Energy branch is $ 2.50/square foot for the addition of R-20+ and $ 3.50/square foot for the addition of R-30+.</ceilingsCathedral>
            </RURComments>
        </Options>
